 <section id="sec:obstructions" class="level2">
 <h2>8 A failed design can state what is missing</h2>
-<p>An empty joined relation establishes infeasibility for its declared finite catalog. A residual requirement describes the capability tuples that would complete fixed existing selections. It retains the relationships between fields and a completion witness for each accepted tuple [<a href="#ref-linking" style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;hyphens:none">1</a>, Section 10].</p>
